"南城の家の中でも自由奔放な考え方の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いまでは家を出て、一人の妻として日々を楽しく暮らしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちづるはそんな姉のことを、内心羨ましく思っているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、本人もちづるのことを気にかけていて、ある日、主人公に接近してくるのだが……!?"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26018","sourceWorkId":"6767","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも妹がお世話になってます。ところで…ちづるは夜の方、どうかしら？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"物腰柔らかなちづるの姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"南城の家の中でも自由奔放な考え方の持ち主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いまでは家を出て、一人の人妻として日々を楽しく暮らしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちづるはそんな姉のことを、内心羨ましく思っているようだ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、本人もちづるのことを気にかけていて、ある日主人公に接近してくるのだが……！？"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"221627"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26018","sourceWorkId":"6767","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"165 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26018","sourceWorkId":"6767","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26018","sourceWorkId":"6767","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26018","sourceWorkId":"6767","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/15/150e4254b64f8ed95ae53cdafad5965255816dc5daaa3bc002c9942611c58e0d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e3/e36ed307c4381eb7912bb61aabb4fc4a262042d7aa6451859a7ac4ca797c789b.webp","width":89,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"AKIRA","creatorId":"egs:creator:6385","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:6385","canonicalEntityId":"egs:creator:6385","name":"AKIRA(声優)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:229621:221627:58682:1","source":"bangumi"},{"creditedName":"AKIRA (seiyuu)","creatorId":"vndb:s4555","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4555","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4555","name":"AKIRA (seiyuu)","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:36352","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21163","characterName":"南城 ちづる","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"221626","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"229621"}],"egsCharacterIds":["26017"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21163"},"originalCharacterName":"南城 ちづる","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"84"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"160cm"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"82"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"実家は華道の家元で、本物のお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自身の華道の腕前も相当な物。その他、護身術として、合気道も嗜んでいる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"成績優秀、スポーツ万能、家事も得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口数も少なく、引っ込み思案でおとなしい性格だが、しっかりした目標、目的がある場合は達成の為、積極的に行動する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、実は授業中居眠りしてたりする一面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"変なものが好きで、他の人と多少ずれた所があるのがたまにキズ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして表情があまり顔に出ないため、周りからは変わってると思われたりする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"顔に出ないと言っても、出ないだけで内心は動揺している。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26017","sourceWorkId":"6767","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ふつつか者ですが、よろしくお願い致します"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実家は華道の家元で、正真正銘、本物のお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自身の華道の腕前も相当な物。成績優秀、スポーツ万能で家事も得意。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、口数が少なく、加えて表情があまり顔に出ないため、周りからは冷たい、変わってる人と勘違いされやすい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"また、変なものが好きで、その所為で他の人と多少ずれた所があるのがたまにキズ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"引っ込み思案でおとなしい性格だが目的達成の為には大胆な行動をする一面も。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"221626"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"84 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26017","sourceWorkId":"6767","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"160 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26017","sourceWorkId":"6767","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"82 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26017","sourceWorkId":"6767","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"55 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"26017","sourceWorkId":"6767","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3e27c15dbaad6354b0635b7aaf198164b2f9fc668b34a5e86c59614ef954dc57.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7aa5cff1cf9e707c78737cbecd4eb9ddfb903909ec5ccd8bbbb2dbdda0eb69ed.webp","width":80,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"永田佳代","creatorId":"vndb:s266","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s266","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s266","name":"永田 佳代","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:229621:221626:6038:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c21164","characterName":"霧村 陽子","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["26016"],"vndbCharacterId":"c21164"},"originalCharacterName":"霧村 陽子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"上品に振舞い、周りからもそういった印象を持たれやすいが、根は意地っ張りで、負けず嫌いな頑固者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"熱くなると口がかなり悪くなる一面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"世間知らずな為に、一般常識に疎く、成績は優秀だが、いまいち考えが浅はかで拙い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おまけに家事全般不得意